331 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 219 0 R
/E (As a B.Tech student in Electrical Engineering at National Institute of Technology Agartala , I had the opportunity to undergo a one-month internship at I.O.C.L., Noonmati \(Guwahati Refinery\). This internship was conducted from 15 Dec 2025 to 6 Jan  2026. During this period, I was exposed to various practical aspects of the refinery, particularly in the Electrical Department and P&U \(Power and Utilities\) Department. This internship allowed me to observe and understand the functioning of several critical systems and technologies in a live industrial environment.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
