/P 255 0 R
/E (A relay is a crucial protective device designed to detect abnormal conditions in an electrical circuit and initiate a trip signal to the associated circuit breaker, thereby isolating the faulty section to prevent damage. In earlier setups at Guwahati Refinery, various electromechanical relays were deployed for protection. However, with advancements in protection and control systems, these traditional relays are being gradually replaced with modern numerical relays.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
995 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 255 0 R
/E (Numerical relays offer improved reliability, faster operation, higher sensitivity, better fault analysis, and easier configuration. These relays incorporate microprocessors and digital signal processing techniques to monitor system conditions and execute precise protection algorithms. At Guwahati Refinery, several types of numerical relays have been installed to protect vital electrical assets, ensuring enhanced operational safety and system integrity.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
