/T (This arc interruption is achieved using different arc-quenching media depending on the type of circuit breaker. Oil circuit breakers, air circuit breakers, and vacuum circuit breakers are commonly used in substations. In Guwahati Refinery, various types of circuit breakers are employed across the substation and field installations to ensure rapid fault isolation, system stability, and personnel safety.)
/E (This arc interruption is achieved using different arc-quenching media depending on the type of circuit breaker. Oil circuit breakers, air circuit breakers, and vacuum circuit breakers are commonly used in substations. In Guwahati Refinery, various types of circuit breakers are employed across the substation and field installations to ensure rapid fault isolation, system stability, and personnel safety.)
